00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
[Upbeat music begins]

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A large rabbit strolls through a meadow.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:24.000
He watches butterflies and flowers around him.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Three small rodents disturb his peace.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:50.000
The rabbit prepares a clever response.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:10.000
A chase unfolds across the forest.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Patience proves stronger than mischief.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Calm returns to the meadow.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:02:10.000
[Music fades]

00:02:10.000 --> 00:09:00.000
[End credits]

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:56.000
The end.
